  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Good "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gnocchi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gnocchi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " should float in the water and feel light in the mouth. Once you have them, the dish is just tomato sauce, mozzarella, and a quick time in the oven to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gratinate",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gratinate"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until the cheese is bubbling and golden at the edges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not overwork the gnocchi dough. Mix just until it comes together. Overworking develops gluten and makes them dense."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
